Subject: [PATCH] css: system fonts follow the claimed platform

For a profile that claims Windows, the menu, small-caption and
status-bar system fonts resolve to "Segoe UI" at 12px, as on real
Windows. Composed profiles never list these fonts, and without this a
Windows profile on a Linux or Mac build reports Arial at 16px. caption,
icon and message-box stay Arial at the default size, which is what macOS
and Linux report for all six. A Windows build gives a macOS or Linux
profile the same Arial answer instead of its own shell fonts.

diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/layout/layout_theme_font_provider_default.cc b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/layout/layout_theme_font_provider_default.cc
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/layout/layout_theme_font_provider_default.cc
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/layout/layout_theme_font_provider_default.cc
@@ -37,7 +37,7 @@
 
